velocitty (1.0.3+emre1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Experimental fork by Emre: https://github.com/emre-erim/velocitty
  * Split terminals, Terminator/Ghostty style
  * 11 palettes converted from Ghostty themes, with light versions
  * Light and dark style buttons work with every palette
  * Main menu moved from F10 to Ctrl+Shift+M
  * Works without xapp.util (python3-xapp < 3.0.3) and without xapp-symbolic-icons

